#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1119 expect=skipped domain=CO
#note "None of the thirteen Permissible Identifier/Timing columns (COGRPID, COREFID, COSPID, VISIT, VISITNUM, VISITDY, TAETORD, CODY, COTPT, COTPTNUM, COELTM, COTPTREF, CORFTDTC) is declared. Since PLAN-any-variable-sets phase 6 (owner ruling 2026-09-18) the rule carries Requirements.Variables.Any with that thirteen-column set as group 1 (and [RDOMAIN, IDVAR] as group 2), so this dataset shape is GATED OFF: SKIPPED, not a silent vacuous pass. Before the gate this scenario pinned the silence itself (expect=noViolation: each leaf is a POSITIVE not empty(X) over an absent column, which EC-43 folds to all-missing, so the first disjunction could never be true). The gate turns that 'I checked and found nothing' into 'there was nothing to check' -- the honest verdict; all thirteen are Permissible in CO, so the dataset shape stays fully conformant and still must not be reported against."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset CO class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Comments"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col RDOMAIN  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col COSEQ    type=Num
col IDVAR    type=Char
col IDVARVAL type=Char
col COVAL    type=Char
---
S1 | CO | AE | 001 | 1 | AESEQ | 1 | Comment on AE record
